<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cancellation & Refund Policy | NetZeroMart</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/netZeroStickerIcon.png" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased font-sans flex flex-col min-h-screen">
    <%- include('../components/header.ejs') %>

    <main class="flex-grow max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950">Cancellation and Refund Policy</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
        </div>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">1. Digital Catalogue Service Nature</h2>
          <p>
            NetZeroMart provides digital listing and catalogue exposure services. Upon successful payment (₹49 for 28 days or ₹499 for 365 days), catalogue visibility is instantly enabled for the vendor.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">2. Cancellation Policy</h2>
          <p>
            Because we do not auto-debit accounts, you are never locked into an ongoing automatic charge. If you choose not to renew, simply let your plan expire. Your products will be temporarily hidden from the public catalogue without any penalty or recurring deduction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">3. Refund Policy</h2>
          <p>
            Due to the instantaneous activation and low nominal fee of digital listing services, subscription fees are generally non-refundable once activated. However, in cases of duplicate debits or technical errors caused by the payment gateway, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:netzeromart@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">netzeromart@gmail.com</a> within 7 days with your transaction ID for an immediate refund investigation.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../components/footer.ejs') %>
  </body>
</html>
